y":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Sullivan County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 50% of normal in August to September and 149% in May to June. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 64% on the middle. Grid 25715 had its driest year in 1980 at 68%.</p>"}
